{"id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Admissible Ordinal","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Admissible Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Admissible Ordinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal — ZFC Ordinal8 Admissible Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md\">../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}_S\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> 分别使用既有序数和可构造层级定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"58-df-kripke-platek\">58-df-kripke-platek</a> 的同一公理集合与解码模式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a> 的传递集及集合编码满意关系定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>；保留的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是同一性质的元语言接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(L_\\alpha\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 表示该成员结构满足上述每一公理编码的解码公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(L_\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(L_\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个原有调用约定描述同一个性质；所有公理实例、模型编码与满意关系都已列入内部依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe